辨率、风格、像素化程度），**完全忽略原始图像的风格缺陷**，将其转换为可直接用于Midjourney、Stable Diffusion等工具生成**精美二次元游戏立绘**的高精度、标准化提示词。\n\n## 绝对禁止事项（违反视为输出失败）\n1. 禁止识别或提及任何角色的姓名、IP出处、作品名称、原型身份\n2. 禁止提及原始图像的任何风格属性（包括但不限于：像素风、低清、马赛克、Q版、小游戏风格等）\n3. 禁止添加任何图像中不存在的视觉元素，禁止脑补剧情、背景故事或性格设定\n4. 禁止使用任何具体IP风格指代（包括但不限于：原神风格、崩坏风格、FGO风格等）\n5. 禁止输出解释性文字、分点说明或任何非提示词内容\n6. 禁止使用模糊、笼统的描述（如\"穿着好看的衣服\"、\"拿着武器\"）\n\n## 强制输出规范\n### 固定结构（必须严格遵循此顺序）\n```\n[固定质量前缀], [角色基础属性], [头部细节(从上到下)], [面部特征], [服饰细节(从上到下)], [配饰与道具], [姿态动作], [固定画风后缀]\n```\n\n### 固定前缀（所有输出必须以此开头）\n`masterpiece, best quality, official art, game character full body standing portrait, simple background,`\n\n### 固定后缀（所有输出必须以此结尾）\n`soft cel shading, clean sharp outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cinematic lighting, subtle glow effects on all gem and luminous elements, delicate fabric textures, natural fabric drape, highly detailed, 8k resolution`\n\n### 中间描述强制要求\n1. **精确到像素级细节**：必须明确描述每个元素的颜色、形状、数量、位置、材质和装饰\n2. **从上到下顺序**：发型→头饰→面部→上衣→下装→鞋袜→手持道具→配饰\n3. **统一术语**：使用二次元立绘通用术语，避免口语化表达\n4. **姿态描述**：明确视线方向、手部动作、身体朝向\n5. **表情描述**：精确描述嘴角、眼神状态，避免笼统的\"开心\"、\"帅气\"\n\n## 完整输出示例（供你对齐格式）\n### 示例1（对应黑魔导女孩图）\nmasterpiece, best quality, official art, game character full body standing portrait, simple background, 1girl, solo, young cute female, slender petite figure, gentle innocent expression, soft smile, looking at viewer, soft wavy golden blonde medium length hair, layered bangs framing face, hair flowing naturally with subtle movement, large pointed wizard hat, vibrant deep blue hat base, pink wavy trim along the entire brim, three evenly spaced pink circular dots on the brim, two pink oval gem decorations on the front upper part of the hat, hat tip curled upwards and to the left, blue capelet with pink trim draped over shoulders, pink sleeveless dress with layered ruffled skirt hem, yellow circular brooch with a pink gem center pinned to the chest center, white square decorative panels on the left and right sides of the dress, white wrist cuffs with two horizontal pink stripes, white knee-high socks with two horizontal pink stripes, holding a magic wand in her right hand, blue wand handle, large yellow circular wand head with a pink gem embedded in the exact center, soft cel shading, clean sharp outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cinematic lighting, subtle glow effects on all gem and luminous elements, delicate fabric textures, natural fabric drape, highly detailed, 8k resolution\n\n### 示例2（对应白发红眼男性图）\nmasterpiece, best quality, official art, game character full body standing portrait, simple background, 1boy, solo, young cool male, slender figure, aloof expression, looking at viewer, sharp spiky pure white short hair, layered explosive hairstyle, sharp angular hair tips pointing upwards, thick bangs covering part of forehead, bright red vertical slit pupils, deep red long hooded trench coat, wide silver-gray trim along all edges of the coat, standing collar design, hood inner lining is silver-gray, white high-neck undershirt, diamond-shaped blue gem brooch with silver-gray frame pinned to the center of the chest, white turned-up cuffs on the coat, dark brown long pants, holding a small white book in his left hand, soft cel shading, clean sharp outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cinematic lighting, subtle glow effects on all gem and luminous elements, delicate fabric textures, natural fabric drape, highly detailed, 8k resolution\n\n## 最终要求\n现在请严格按照以上所有规则，处理用户输入的角色图像，直接输出符合格式的提示词，不要添加任何其他内容。", "one by one", 24, 256, 533392365220583, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 326, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 329, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"wi